10:Tb6a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』慈伝 日日の葉よ散るらむ","description":"「刀ステ」史上最多（当時）の19振りが集結した、シリーズ初の本格「日常コメディ」群像劇。 『悲伝』の激闘を経て、刀剣男士たちは審神者の命により新たな本丸へと拠点を移すこととなる。思い出の品を抱えた引っ越し作業のドタバタや、新天地での生活に戸惑いながらも順応していく刀剣男士たちの和やかな交流が描かれる。賑やかなコメディテイストで進む一方で、深まりゆく秋の風と共に新たな仲間が顕現し、本丸の絆が緩やかに、しかし確実に再構築されていく過程を綴った、優しくも切ないインターリュード。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-jiden","keywords":"ゲーム原作, 群像のうまみ, エモい, 世界観つよめ","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"健人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kento"},{"@type":"Person","name":"加藤 将","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kato-sho"},{"@type":"Person","name":"川上 将大","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kawakami-shota"},{"@type":"Person","name":"磯野 大","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/isono-dai"},{"@type":"Person","name":"飯山 裕太","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/iiyama-yuta"},{"@type":"Person","name":"木津 つばさ","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kizu-tsubasa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"大崎 捺希","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/osaki-natsuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"設楽 銀河","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shitara-ginga"},{"@type":"Person","name":"横山 真史","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yokoyama-masafumi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"武子 直輝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takeshi-naoki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"前山 剛久","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/maeyama-takahisa"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小林 涼","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kobayashi-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小坂 涼太郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kosaka-ryotaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"谷水 力","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/tanimizu-riki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"梅津 瑞樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/umetsu-mizuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"蒼木 陣","url":"https://s